# WebView2 Fixed Version 109 runtime (~250MB, not for git)
# Download manually from:
#   https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Web.WebView2/109.0.1518.78
#   or https://github.com/thecosmicfrog/WebView2Samples/releases
# Extract to: src-tauri/WebView2-FixedRuntime-109/
src-tauri/WebView2-FixedRuntime-109/

# Release config (contains local paths)
.claude/release-config.json

# C 编译产物（MSVC .obj 文件）
*.obj

# 设计稿/原型/临时输出（不进仓库）
output/

# B 站调试产物（本地保留，不进任何远程仓库）
bili_*.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Local-only ppt-master native debug loop artifacts (payload snapshots/results may contain user material)
analysis/ppt_native_loop/

